incident" sparked a major fire at a military base in Alberta. He did not provide details on the cause of the fire.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'No Kings' rallies push early voting ahead of US midterm elections</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f8596f0b23d651e76b0510c8ae24ab4cad212391849db896e4fb5671dde57308</id><updated>2026-10-18T04:48:14Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T00:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/no-kings-rallies-push-early-voting-ahead-of-us-midterm-elections/a-79690502--c2c75c7f5f7c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/no-kings-rallies-push-early-voting-ahead-of-us-midterm-elections/a-79690502?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Organizers of the "No Kings" protests, known for their anti-Trump sentiment, are urging Americans to vote early in the November 3 midterm elections, as Republicans face tough races to retain control of Congress.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ilhan Omar: The US Democrat targeted by Donald Trump</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9f73dc3f27ed854dd59f67859a89024d347396cbc5cdfa5fd49c9f2ed8750bc3</id><updated>2026-10-18T04:48:17Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T19:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ilhan-omar-the-us-democrat-targeted-by-donald-trump/a-79688445--0b2fbb5ba398.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ilhan-omar-the-us-democrat-targeted-by-donald-trump/a-79688445?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump has described her as "garbage" and a "criminal" who does nothing but "bitch." Congress member Ilhan Omar has long been the target of angry verbal attacks from the US president. But why her?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Romanian fighter jets shoot down 2 drones over Black Sea</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:edd901cdfe08922ad369d45d44242af0152098337c355ab1b40bb1a104247a9d</id>